(5700344, 829617, 27161, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of perfect lighting, composition, and attention to detail the IreneM does so well.  Great job whoever you are.</td>', 'This is the kind of perfect lighting, composition, and attention to detail the IreneM does so well.  Great job whoever you are.', '2009-10-26 00:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700345, 829458, 111032, '<td valign="top">i almost didnt notice the duck haha. i really like this</td>', 'i almost didnt notice the duck haha. i really like this', '2009-10-26 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700349, 829211, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, though the disappearing shoulder detracts for me, and is evocative more of "blown" than "high key" in my view.  Otherwise beautifully executed. 8</td>', 'Lovely portrait, though the disappearing shoulder detracts for me, and is evocative more of "blown" than "high key" in my view.  Otherwise beautifully executed. 8', '2009-10-26 00:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700351, 829458, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I like that a lot.  I like the invisible diagonal line between the single swan and the foggy pier with the two people barely visible. NICE</td>', 'Oh I like that a lot.  I like the invisible diagonal line between the single swan and the foggy pier with the two people barely visible. NICE', '2009-10-26 00:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700353, 829498, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Lots of nice portraits in this challenge, and this is no exception.  Well executed, a nice example of how a tight portrait can really work. 8</td>', 'Lovely.  Lots of nice portraits in this challenge, and this is no exception.  Well executed, a nice example of how a tight portrait can really work. 8', '2009-10-26 00:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700354, 829612, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really pretty.  Soft focus certainly comes to mind as well. :~)</td>', 'Really pretty.  Soft focus certainly comes to mind as well. :~)', '2009-10-26 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700359, 829601, 52336, '<td valign="top">In my personal opinion, low key swans wouldn''t work as well as high key swans, though I''m sure your choice was forced by shooting conditions. 5</td>', 'In my personal opinion, low key swans wouldn''t work as well as high key swans, though I''m sure your choice was forced by shooting conditions. 5', '2009-10-26 00:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700362, 829322, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and what light! 7</td>', 'Nicely composed, and what light! 7', '2009-10-26 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700363, 828407, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that is excellent. Intense textures and focus.  I''d say bokeh, centered composition and tilted angle. LOL</td>', 'Oh that is excellent. Intense textures and focus.  I''d say bokeh, centered composition and tilted angle. LOL', '2009-10-26 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700364, 829591, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this. Simple, greeting card worthy.</td>', 'Love this. Simple, greeting card worthy.', '2009-10-26 00:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700365, 828901, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, though I think "leading lines" is a stretch... let''s say "rule of thirds". ;) 7</td>', 'Nice portrait, though I think "leading lines" is a stretch... let''s say "rule of thirds". ;) 7', '2009-10-26 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700366, 829459, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Really crisp.</td>', 'Nice.  Really crisp.', '2009-10-26 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700369, 828707, 15711, '<td valign="top">YUMMILICIOUS colors!!!</td>', 'YUMMILICIOUS colors!!!', '2009-10-26 00:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700370, 829295, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! 7</td>', 'Very interesting! 7', '2009-10-26 00:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700372, 829525, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh goodness!!!!  This is so quaint and charming.  Just beautiful.  Looks like a storybook land!! If I could change anything, the pylons with the chains wouldn''t be there.</td>', 'Oh goodness!!!!  This is so quaint and charming.  Just beautiful.  Looks like a storybook land!! If I could change anything, the pylons with the chains wouldn''t be there.', '2009-10-26 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700374, 829487, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Great lighting and use of contrast. Stunning.</td>', 'I love this.  Great lighting and use of contrast. Stunning.', '2009-10-26 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700375, 829448, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really charming.  So honest and fresh.</td>', 'Really charming.  So honest and fresh.', '2009-10-26 00:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700376, 829573, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I really like this.  Low key could be thrown into the description too.</td>', 'Oh I really like this.  Low key could be thrown into the description too.', '2009-10-26 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700377, 829486, 15711, '<td valign="top">Narrow depth of field too. :~)  Love the rich greens.</td>', 'Narrow depth of field too. :~)  Love the rich greens.', '2009-10-26 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700378, 829554, 90387, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of all three!  Beautiful colors as well!  Great job!</td>', 'Excellent example of all three!  Beautiful colors as well!  Great job!', '2009-10-26 01:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700382, 829141, 52336, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the softness and the table line... really nicely done.  I''m just concerned with the highlights by the lamp, either blown, or rendered artificial in post (this often happens to me adjusting tone curve or "clarity").  But I like it otherwise, very engaging. 8</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the softness and the table line... really nicely done.  I''m just concerned with the highlights by the lamp, either blown, or rendered artificial in post (this often happens to me adjusting tone curve or "clarity").  But I like it otherwise, very engaging. 8', '2009-10-26 01:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700391, 829487, 46177, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, I love her expression and actually everything about this, I gave you a 10. I think this should ribbon.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, I love her expression and actually everything about this, I gave you a 10. I think this should ribbon.', '2009-10-26 01:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700393, 829525, 46177, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the shine on the wet sidewalk, beautifully done. 10</td>', 'Love the colours and the shine on the wet sidewalk, beautifully done. 10', '2009-10-26 01:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700396, 829498, 46177, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of course it helps that she is so pretty. 10</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of course it helps that she is so pretty. 10', '2009-10-26 01:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700421, 829201, 52336, '<td valign="top">That''s neat.  A real sense of story.  Gritty and evocative.  Beautiful. 8</td>', 'That''s neat.  A real sense of story.  Gritty and evocative.  Beautiful. 8', '2009-10-26 01:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700422, 829580, 61084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but looks more like a Deep DOP to me. A little over sharpened or dodged on the middle rocks I feel. Still I love the shot. 8</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but looks more like a Deep DOP to me. A little over sharpened or dodged on the middle rocks I feel. Still I love the shot. 8', '2009-10-26 01:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700428, 829178, 111032, '<td valign="top">i like how the trees/plant frame the shot. great shot</td>', 'i like how the trees/plant frame the shot. great shot', '2009-10-26 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700445, 829478, 61084, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Not sure why you didn''t crop out the green stem or whatever it is near the top right corner though. I like the softness of the petals though... 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Not sure why you didn''t crop out the green stem or whatever it is near the top right corner though. I like the softness of the petals though... 7', '2009-10-26 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700477, 829580, 30861, '<td valign="top">Centered Composition, check. Leading Lines, not so much for me, but implied. Shallow DOF, no way. This is sharp from infinity right up to the very foreground. Did ya type the wrong one in?</td>', 'Centered Composition, check. Leading Lines, not so much for me, but implied. Shallow DOF, no way. This is sharp from infinity right up to the very foreground. Did ya type the wrong one in?', '2009-10-26 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700483, 828789, 30861, '<td valign="top">This comes across much more as a centered composition than it does as rule of thirds. Striking image, regardless.</td>', 'This comes across much more as a centered composition than it does as rule of thirds. Striking image, regardless.', '2009-10-26 01:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700487, 829616, 61084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but why didn''t you clone out the hot pixels in the upper right?</td>', 'Beautiful, but why didn''t you clone out the hot pixels in the upper right?', '2009-10-26 02:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700511, 829465, 22301, '<td valign="top">If you send a ticket via the Help Menu, they can fix the spelling mistake for you. Good luck. nice image.</td>', 'If you send a ticket via the Help Menu, they can fix the spelling mistake for you. Good luck. nice image.', '2009-10-26 02:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700522, 829465, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow - very nice. I''m not familiar with Johnny Depp''s DOF work, but it looks good here. :P</td>', 'Wow - very nice. I''m not familiar with Johnny Depp''s DOF work, but it looks good here. :P', '2009-10-26 02:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700556, 829061, 30861, '<td valign="top">But... The fly is *centered*... If you''d used "centered" as one of your 3 there''d be no argument with that. I can see where you have the eyes on 1/3 lines, so you call that ROT, but to my eye it''s more of a centered photo... Also, I see the shallow DOF for sure, but the soft focus totally is not there, except inasmuch as there are OOF areas front and back; but the image itself is tack-sharp, incredibly detailed, about as far from *soft focus* as you can get... <br/> <br/>Outstanding macro, though :-)</td>', 'But... The fly is *centered*... If you''d used "centered" as one of your 3 there''d be no argument with that. I can see where you have the eyes on 1/3 lines, so you call that ROT, but to my eye it''s more of a centered photo... Also, I see the shallow DOF for sure, but the soft focus totally is not there, except inasmuch as there are OOF areas front and back; but the image itself is tack-sharp, incredibly detailed, about as far from *soft focus* as you can get...  Outstanding macro, though :-)', '2009-10-26 04:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700566, 829132, 7010, '<td valign="top">DOF is shallow, but point of focus is spot on! Very natural expression of the model. Welldone!</td>', 'DOF is shallow, but point of focus is spot on! Very natural expression of the model. Welldone!', '2009-10-26 04:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700569, 829588, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... A bit of a stretchy interpretation of the mentioned techniques. Not very low key. Not exactly leading lines as they normally should lead the viewers eye into the picture and/or to the main subject. Rule of thirds, well... Ok, but I rather call it centered composition...<br/>But... Aside from that a well executed close-up, sharp, nice lighting. I only would have centered the object slightly more to the down-right.</td>', 'Hmmm... A bit of a stretchy interpretation of the mentioned techniques. Not very low key. Not exactly leading lines as they normally should lead the viewers eye into the picture and/or to the main subject. Rule of thirds, well... Ok, but I rather call it centered composition...But... Aside from that a well executed close-up, sharp, nice lighting. I only would have centered the object slightly more to the down-right.', '2009-10-26 04:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700570, 829060, 7010, '<td valign="top">I love the angled structure of the rocks that accompany the leading (coast-)line. It makes it, together with the water, a very dynamic picture. Well seen!</td>', 'I love the angled structure of the rocks that accompany the leading (coast-)line. It makes it, together with the water, a very dynamic picture. Well seen!', '2009-10-26 04:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700575, 829138, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... this image gets me in a cuddling mood ;-)<br/>Pity of the shadow line on her body.<br/>I''m usually confused about the term bokeh, but I think it refers to the circular formed spots you get (due to the shape of the diaphragm) that are typical when you photograph a background with e.g. sparkling reflections of light. So I wouldn''t call this bokeh. But that''s in my shallow experience and opinion of course ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm... this image gets me in a cuddling mood ;-)Pity of the shadow line on her body.I''m usually confused about the term bokeh, but I think it refers to the circular formed spots you get (due to the shape of the diaphragm) that are typical when you photograph a background with e.g. sparkling reflections of light. So I wouldn''t call this bokeh. But that''s in my shallow experience and opinion of course ;-)', '2009-10-26 04:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700577, 829061, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition and focus. I always wonder how to get this kind of shots without glueing the bug to the surface ;-) Welldone.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition and focus. I always wonder how to get this kind of shots without glueing the bug to the surface ;-) Welldone.', '2009-10-26 04:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700580, 829601, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Something bothers me about the composition, but I can''t really put my finger on it. The first thing that comes up is the lighting, that leads the attention to the wing of the swan, wich is not the most interesting part imo. The focus should be on the heads, and they''re too dark. Also the positioning of the swans (the relation between the two) doesn''t tell much of a story. Therefore the back swan doesn''t add much interest to the whole.</td>', 'Hmmm... Something bothers me about the composition, but I can''t really put my finger on it. The first thing that comes up is the lighting, that leads the attention to the wing of the swan, wich is not the most interesting part imo. The focus should be on the heads, and they''re too dark. Also the positioning of the swans (the relation between the two) doesn''t tell much of a story. Therefore the back swan doesn''t add much interest to the whole.', '2009-10-26 05:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700582, 829144, 109478, '<td valign="top">I am the other one who didn''t list 3 techniques in title. Welcome to the DNMC Club. (sigh~)</td>', 'I am the other one who didn''t list 3 techniques in title. Welcome to the DNMC Club. (sigh~)', '2009-10-26 05:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700583, 829567, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh on the background, but imho it would have been even better when the green directly behind the bird was also more blurred. Also the tiny, in-focus snowflakes distract. Probably better to clone them out. Nice focus on the bird and nice composition.</td>', 'Nice bokeh on the background, but imho it would have been even better when the green directly behind the bird was also more blurred. Also the tiny, in-focus snowflakes distract. Probably better to clone them out. Nice focus on the bird and nice composition.', '2009-10-26 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700585, 829559, 69368, '<td valign="top">this is really beautiful!perfect autumn-impression!</td>', 'this is really beautiful!perfect autumn-impression!', '2009-10-26 05:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700586, 829458, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice sober, moody picture. Less is more, proven once again. A tiny nitpick: I would have liked it better when the bird was more on the crossing of the third-lines. Over all, welldone!</td>', 'Nice sober, moody picture. Less is more, proven once again. A tiny nitpick: I would have liked it better when the bird was more on the crossing of the third-lines. Over all, welldone!', '2009-10-26 05:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
