(5700624, 828651, 49109, '<td valign="top">definitely meets challenge (in addition, it has Deep DOF). You went a little far  with sharpening IMO. The border color doesn''t help the image</td>', 'definitely meets challenge (in addition, it has Deep DOF). You went a little far  with sharpening IMO. The border color doesn''t help the image', '2009-10-26 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700625, 829525, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice! Every element in this image is in place and benefits the composition. Welldone</td>', 'Nice! Every element in this image is in place and benefits the composition. Welldone', '2009-10-26 06:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700627, 829477, 49109, '<td valign="top">honestly, I can''t see any of the three techniques being used here. The field is not in focus at the left side; there''s no  special point of interest on any third''s crossing and the horizon is almost center; some of the blades are motion blurred and "stop action" usually refers to people, animals or objects with rapid movement.<br/>The image itself lacks of color and impact, there are some sensor spots, and finally, it is oversharpened.</td>', 'honestly, I can''t see any of the three techniques being used here. The field is not in focus at the left side; there''s no  special point of interest on any third''s crossing and the horizon is almost center; some of the blades are motion blurred and "stop action" usually refers to people, animals or objects with rapid movement.The image itself lacks of color and impact, there are some sensor spots, and finally, it is oversharpened.', '2009-10-26 06:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700631, 829516, 49109, '<td valign="top">well done, though I had cropped off a bit at top, to make the comp even more centered</td>', 'well done, though I had cropped off a bit at top, to make the comp even more centered', '2009-10-26 06:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
