(5700635, 829617, 49109, '<td valign="top">definitely not low key, and, as the viewers focus is lead to the tip of the sharpie, not really centered composition. technically well done, though</td>', 'definitely not low key, and, as the viewers focus is lead to the tip of the sharpie, not really centered composition. technically well done, though', '2009-10-26 06:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
