(5700639, 829591, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I gave you a 4 on this one: Soft focus allways gives a kind of dreamy feel to an image, and the subject is always sharp and in focus, but with a kind of haze laying on top of it. Most soft focus images also don''t have a strong contrast. <br/>This isn''t soft focus image imo, but just an out of focus one. (Soft focus is always achieved with a special soft focus filter attached to the lens, or with a PS technique involving a blurred, in opacity reduced layer on top of the original). Also the leading lines are not very convincing.</td>', 'Hmmm... I gave you a 4 on this one: Soft focus allways gives a kind of dreamy feel to an image, and the subject is always sharp and in focus, but with a kind of haze laying on top of it. Most soft focus images also don''t have a strong contrast. This isn''t soft focus image imo, but just an out of focus one. (Soft focus is always achieved with a special soft focus filter attached to the lens, or with a PS technique involving a blurred, in opacity reduced layer on top of the original). Also the leading lines are not very convincing.', '2009-10-26 06:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5700641, 829305, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice and moody. Welldone</td>', 'Nice and moody. Welldone', '2009-10-26 06:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
