(5700921, 829526, 110909, '<td valign="top">not sure it exactly meets the challenge but i like it anyway so i''m giving it a 6.  the deep dof thing is the tuffy and i''d like to see more of his left eye.  his skin tone is amazing, tho</td>', 'not sure it exactly meets the challenge but i like it anyway so i''m giving it a 6.  the deep dof thing is the tuffy and i''d like to see more of his left eye.  his skin tone is amazing, tho', '2009-10-26 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
