(5700926, 829157, 110909, '<td valign="top">oh no!  you forgot your techniques :(  i''m going to guess:  centered composition, leading lines and long exposure?  i''m not going to kill it for not having the techniques in the title but feel like a sharper focus on this would have made it more dynamic.  5</td>', 'oh no!  you forgot your techniques :(  i''m going to guess:  centered composition, leading lines and long exposure?  i''m not going to kill it for not having the techniques in the title but feel like a sharper focus on this would have made it more dynamic.  5', '2009-10-26 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
