(5701553, 829423, 103142, '<td valign="top">seems a tad over-sharpened. wonderful catch, however! I''m not sure I agree on portrait for a bird, but I can be open-minded and won''t change the vote. However, it is a bit noisy. If you try de-noising it, it might take down the sharpening a tad and be more pleasing aesthetically. -7-</td>', 'seems a tad over-sharpened. wonderful catch, however! I''m not sure I agree on portrait for a bird, but I can be open-minded and won''t change the vote. However, it is a bit noisy. If you try de-noising it, it might take down the sharpening a tad and be more pleasing aesthetically. -7-', '2009-10-26 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701555, 828912, 103142, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems more up and to the right than backlit, but I''ll believe it for voting purposes :D This is lovely and nicely done.  -7-</td>', 'The lighting seems more up and to the right than backlit, but I''ll believe it for voting purposes :D This is lovely and nicely done.  -7-', '2009-10-26 21:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701561, 829580, 103142, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t look like shallow depth of field. My eyes are lousy, but looks pretty deep to me. (but then again, I don''t focus well on small things.)</td>', 'This really doesn''t look like shallow depth of field. My eyes are lousy, but looks pretty deep to me. (but then again, I don''t focus well on small things.)', '2009-10-26 21:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701564, 829538, 56828, '<td valign="top">This photo is suffering from over edit.  I don''t think you blended your blur very well...especially at the part where it gets into her hair.  It had the potential to be a top photo in the challenge.  The skin is nice and smooth just the blur should mesh better.</td>', 'This photo is suffering from over edit.  I don''t think you blended your blur very well...especially at the part where it gets into her hair.  It had the potential to be a top photo in the challenge.  The skin is nice and smooth just the blur should mesh better.', '2009-10-26 21:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701565, 829547, 36981, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this image; her expression is ambiguous enough that it''s something I want to look at for a while to figure out.  I don''t see the high key in this, so I''m substituting "soft focus" in the title for myself and then it all works really well.</td>', 'I enjoy this image; her expression is ambiguous enough that it''s something I want to look at for a while to figure out.  I don''t see the high key in this, so I''m substituting "soft focus" in the title for myself and then it all works really well.', '2009-10-26 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701567, 829612, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think it''s interesting the people who are doing deep dof and blur. The only way I can tell is if the blur is the same from front to back. It looks that way, so I''ll believe it! Nice colors. Fun choice.</td>', 'I think it''s interesting the people who are doing deep dof and blur. The only way I can tell is if the blur is the same from front to back. It looks that way, so I''ll believe it! Nice colors. Fun choice.', '2009-10-26 21:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701568, 829571, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your portraits actually lead my eyes right to the center.  I think you better gathered center composition than ROT.  Also should tone down the overexposure at the top of the veil.  I love the way you captured both girls smile  without losing detail in their faces.</td>', 'Your portraits actually lead my eyes right to the center.  I think you better gathered center composition than ROT.  Also should tone down the overexposure at the top of the veil.  I love the way you captured both girls smile  without losing detail in their faces.', '2009-10-26 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
