(5701645, 828894, 37845, '<td valign="top">It must be tough to put in a blur shot into a challenge like this, as even blur shots in their own challenges often get knocked around with low votes. This shot, however, is very strong. The blur adds nicely to the shot, it is very well composed, and creates a rural/prairie feel to it. Good luck.</td>', 'It must be tough to put in a blur shot into a challenge like this, as even blur shots in their own challenges often get knocked around with low votes. This shot, however, is very strong. The blur adds nicely to the shot, it is very well composed, and creates a rural/prairie feel to it. Good luck.', '2009-10-26 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
