(5701889, 829138, 56828, '<td valign="top">It looks closer to center composition to me, but I love how sharp the photo is and the color you captured on the calf.  The early morning/late evening sun brings out the color</td>', 'It looks closer to center composition to me, but I love how sharp the photo is and the color you captured on the calf.  The early morning/late evening sun brings out the color', '2009-10-27 09:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701891, 829488, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think you went too far with the high key attempted.  You lose her entire chin, neck, shoulders, arm, and wrists.  Even some ofo the outline of her hand.  You could be better served showing the entire broken umbrella as well to give it a little more personality.</td>', 'I think you went too far with the high key attempted.  You lose her entire chin, neck, shoulders, arm, and wrists.  Even some ofo the outline of her hand.  You could be better served showing the entire broken umbrella as well to give it a little more personality.', '2009-10-27 09:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701894, 829211, 56828, '<td valign="top">I love the hair and skin.  I think you did a great job capturing the portrait.  Can''t tell whethere I like the edit on the eyes or not, there is just something slightly bothering me about her left eye (my right).  My only real problem with the fold is the complete lose of detail on her shoulder.  It looks like half her body is missing.</td>', 'I love the hair and skin.  I think you did a great job capturing the portrait.  Can''t tell whethere I like the edit on the eyes or not, there is just something slightly bothering me about her left eye (my right).  My only real problem with the fold is the complete lose of detail on her shoulder.  It looks like half her body is missing.', '2009-10-27 09:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701958, 829606, 98339, '<td valign="top">tho I like the picture, I wish more of it were in focus (mind you just a bit more)..really like the colors in the background...well done</td>', 'tho I like the picture, I wish more of it were in focus (mind you just a bit more)..really like the colors in the background...well done', '2009-10-27 10:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701959, 829241, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a very pleasing photo,  I really do like the soothing water.</td>', 'this is a very pleasing photo,  I really do like the soothing water.', '2009-10-27 10:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701966, 829594, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice earthquake! Does the tilted angle help this view or enhance it''s enegry in any way?</td>', 'Nice earthquake! Does the tilted angle help this view or enhance it''s enegry in any way?', '2009-10-27 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701967, 829573, 98339, '<td valign="top">to me I would like to see the background a bit more even in color/tone, really like everything else in the picture...well done</td>', 'to me I would like to see the background a bit more even in color/tone, really like everything else in the picture...well done', '2009-10-27 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701969, 829132, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re hearing plenty of this but the eyes are pretty sharp (extremely) sharp kinda killing the soft focus, claim. I''m not sure if you are latching the soft focus onto the shallow dof but if so it''s redundant.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re hearing plenty of this but the eyes are pretty sharp (extremely) sharp kinda killing the soft focus, claim. I''m not sure if you are latching the soft focus onto the shallow dof but if so it''s redundant.', '2009-10-27 10:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701972, 829612, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I don''t like what has happened to some of the colors as much, not sure if that is in the PP or the blur of the picture...overall I do like it alot</td>', 'I really like this picture, but I don''t like what has happened to some of the colors as much, not sure if that is in the PP or the blur of the picture...overall I do like it alot', '2009-10-27 10:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5701974, 829061, 32767, '<td valign="top">The eyes and head are too sharp to call this soft focus and even though parts of the fly cross the 3rds lines it seems more centered in essence, as a composition.</td>', 'The eyes and head are too sharp to call this soft focus and even though parts of the fly cross the 3rds lines it seems more centered in essence, as a composition.', '2009-10-27 10:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
