(5704113, 829137, 83313, '<td valign="top">The fogginess works nicely, and I like the way you brought in the overhead lines as a compositional element instead of the distraction the normally are.</td>', 'The fogginess works nicely, and I like the way you brought in the overhead lines as a compositional element instead of the distraction the normally are.', '2009-10-28 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
