(5705060, 829205, 110909, '<td valign="top">this one, i voted on instinct.  i really liked it so i gave it an 8.  the only issue i have is there doesn''t feel like there''s any place for my eyes to rest after following all of those leading lines.  one leads into another.  which, i suppose is what i appreciated about it in the first place and why i gave it an 8. <br/> <br/>never mind.  this comment says nothing.  :)</td>', 'this one, i voted on instinct.  i really liked it so i gave it an 8.  the only issue i have is there doesn''t feel like there''s any place for my eyes to rest after following all of those leading lines.  one leads into another.  which, i suppose is what i appreciated about it in the first place and why i gave it an 8.  never mind.  this comment says nothing.  :)', '2009-10-29 03:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705195, 829580, 93756, '<td valign="top">Voting as if you''d said "deep DOF"</td>', 'Voting as if you''d said "deep DOF"', '2009-10-29 08:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705198, 829459, 93756, '<td valign="top">Very well executed techniques: sharp, clean, and well-composed. Just needs something more to keep my interest. 7</td>', 'Very well executed techniques: sharp, clean, and well-composed. Just needs something more to keep my interest. 7', '2009-10-29 08:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705201, 829535, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment and good use of the techniques. I feel like the whole thing is leaning to the left.</td>', 'Nice treatment and good use of the techniques. I feel like the whole thing is leaning to the left.', '2009-10-29 08:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705204, 829138, 93756, '<td valign="top">I would have gone with "centered" on this one. Nice portrait but the shadow line does mar it.</td>', 'I would have gone with "centered" on this one. Nice portrait but the shadow line does mar it.', '2009-10-29 08:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705206, 829507, 93756, '<td valign="top">Can you have both centered and rule of thirds? Surely you meant centered and portrait. Still a great photo - original and well-lit.</td>', 'Can you have both centered and rule of thirds? Surely you meant centered and portrait. Still a great photo - original and well-lit.', '2009-10-29 08:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705207, 829599, 56828, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t much here.  I wish there were something here to add interest to the p hoto.  I''m also not a big fan of the interesting parts of your subject fading to blur.</td>', 'There really isn''t much here.  I wish there were something here to add interest to the p hoto.  I''m also not a big fan of the interesting parts of your subject fading to blur.', '2009-10-29 08:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705209, 829524, 56828, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great.  The tone is great.  The pose isn''t so great.  I don''t understand the concept of turning her head.  The arm that is viewed is seems ill posed and should be closer to the body or more interesting.</td>', 'The lighting is great.  The tone is great.  The pose isn''t so great.  I don''t understand the concept of turning her head.  The arm that is viewed is seems ill posed and should be closer to the body or more interesting.', '2009-10-29 08:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705212, 829297, 56828, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few extreme tilts that I like.  Most of the other tilts did not workf or the phots  This did. I''m not quite sure what the purpose of the moon was other than filling up negative space.</td>', 'This is one of the few extreme tilts that I like.  Most of the other tilts did not workf or the phots  This did. I''m not quite sure what the purpose of the moon was other than filling up negative space.', '2009-10-29 08:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705218, 829477, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your stop action is very subtle and alot of peole are probably missing it. some would expect a more extreme action shot rather than just wind blowing because the stalks could look like this in the very slightest of winds.  I''m not sure if I would classify this as deep DOF.  Your closest points are not as in focus as your furthest points, but it may be enough not to be too nitpicky about it.  For me, my eyes are drawn across the center of the shot horizontally, which makes it hard to see a rule of thirds.  As for aesthetic quality.  I like the photo.  I t probably could have been boosted by bumping up the brightness (curves layer).</td>', 'Your stop action is very subtle and alot of peole are probably missing it. some would expect a more extreme action shot rather than just wind blowing because the stalks could look like this in the very slightest of winds.  I''m not sure if I would classify this as deep DOF.  Your closest points are not as in focus as your furthest points, but it may be enough not to be too nitpicky about it.  For me, my eyes are drawn across the center of the shot horizontally, which makes it hard to see a rule of thirds.  As for aesthetic quality.  I like the photo.  I t probably could have been boosted by bumping up the brightness (curves layer).', '2009-10-29 08:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705233, 829151, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your Bokeh doesn''t really add or take away from the photo.  To me it''s just Shallow DOF.  YOur sun his too harsh on his face and his facial expression is not good.  It looks as if he smells something foul.  I thnk the crop is a bad crop.  The soft light does try and help bring something to the photo.  I like that part.</td>', 'Your Bokeh doesn''t really add or take away from the photo.  To me it''s just Shallow DOF.  YOur sun his too harsh on his face and his facial expression is not good.  It looks as if he smells something foul.  I thnk the crop is a bad crop.  The soft light does try and help bring something to the photo.  I like that part.', '2009-10-29 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705278, 829341, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water is captured using the long exposure to blur it and give it motion.  I think your angle and tight crop aren''t adding much to the photo though.</td>', 'I like the way the water is captured using the long exposure to blur it and give it motion.  I think your angle and tight crop aren''t adding much to the photo though.', '2009-10-29 09:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705282, 829523, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your bokeh background really adds anything to the way the photo is viewed and could be considered more Shallow DOF.  The photo is plain and simple which is nice, but there is nothing really to give it an extra boost or to make it stand out.  The black and white is a great look for it.</td>', 'I don''t think your bokeh background really adds anything to the way the photo is viewed and could be considered more Shallow DOF.  The photo is plain and simple which is nice, but there is nothing really to give it an extra boost or to make it stand out.  The black and white is a great look for it.', '2009-10-29 09:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705363, 829544, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think the artistic effect didnt work out all too well here.  I think the blown out parts make it hard to enjoy the scene that you were trying to portray here.  If it were toned down some I think i would have enjoyed this shot better.</td>', 'I think the artistic effect didnt work out all too well here.  I think the blown out parts make it hard to enjoy the scene that you were trying to portray here.  If it were toned down some I think i would have enjoyed this shot better.', '2009-10-29 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705381, 829606, 73348, '<td valign="top">by far my favourite in this challenge.  the thin line of focus and the colour wheel effect of the bokeh background is excellent.</td>', 'by far my favourite in this challenge.  the thin line of focus and the colour wheel effect of the bokeh background is excellent.', '2009-10-29 11:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5705387, 829423, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Portrait" is a stretch here, especially since the beak is a GREAT leading line from eyeball to fish... "Stop Action" comes to mind also. Great capture!</td>', '"Portrait" is a stretch here, especially since the beak is a GREAT leading line from eyeball to fish... "Stop Action" comes to mind also. Great capture!', '2009-10-29 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
