(5705473, 829538, 93756, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. Love the focus on the eye and the necklace. Love the almost all the way blurred shoulders. The dark frame of the mirror in the background detracts from what otherwise is near perfect.</td>', 'This is terrific. Love the focus on the eye and the necklace. Love the almost all the way blurred shoulders. The dark frame of the mirror in the background detracts from what otherwise is near perfect.', '2009-10-29 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
