(5706630, 828685, 83313, '<td valign="top">I want to be able to do people shots this well someday. Faving this one and giving it a very high vote. I''ll be interested in the details of this shot.</td>', 'I want to be able to do people shots this well someday. Faving this one and giving it a very high vote. I''ll be interested in the details of this shot.', '2009-10-30 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706633, 829610, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very cute shot, one that should be on your wall. (Or in an advertisement for Old Navy)However there is a major issue that nobody else will likely recognize for what it is.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', strrpos(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif"/>JPEG police here. We have a warrant.<br/> <br/>There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 44k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)<br/> <br/>Oh, yes, and use the available 720 pixels on at least one side to get maximum detail into the image.</td>', 'A very cute shot, one that should be on your wall. (Or in an advertisement for Old Navy)However there is a major issue that nobody else will likely recognize for what it is. JPEG police here. We have a warrant. There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 44k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one) Oh, yes, and use the available 720 pixels on at least one side to get maximum detail into the image.', '2009-10-30 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706636, 828789, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this comes off top me as rule of thirds, or centered comp. I am finding on many of these, that people look at different areas to judge the compositional concepts. I guess it depends on what elements one''s eye is drawn to.</td>', 'Not sure if this comes off top me as rule of thirds, or centered comp. I am finding on many of these, that people look at different areas to judge the compositional concepts. I guess it depends on what elements one''s eye is drawn to.', '2009-10-30 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706637, 829533, 83313, '<td valign="top"><strike>I''d call this rule of thirds rather than centered comp, due to where the horizon and rock are.</strike> Now I see you used both in your title. I think that is en excellent way of pointing out that several compositional concepts can coexist in the same scene.</td>', 'I''d call this rule of thirds rather than centered comp, due to where the horizon and rock are. Now I see you used both in your title. I think that is en excellent way of pointing out that several compositional concepts can coexist in the same scene.', '2009-10-30 13:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706709, 829524, 111123, '<td valign="top">Very nice Sue!</td>', 'Very nice Sue!', '2009-10-30 15:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706741, 829538, 111360, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I love the necklace</td>', 'Good photo. I love the necklace', '2009-10-30 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706777, 829547, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, very emotive. Ignoring the challenge topic I would score this very high. This definitely does not qualify as a deep DOF. You have a wonderfully blurred background and out of focus hair.It''s difficult for me to see the focal point other than the nose and lips. I also do not consider this high key as you have a reasonably broad range of tones from pure black to almost white. A high key image should produce a histogram that is shifted greatly to the right. I''m giving you a 5 because I really like the portrait, emotion, and processing. Great job. (my choice would have been: portrait, rule of third (eyes), and soft focus)</td>', 'Lovely portrait, very emotive. Ignoring the challenge topic I would score this very high. This definitely does not qualify as a deep DOF. You have a wonderfully blurred background and out of focus hair.It''s difficult for me to see the focal point other than the nose and lips. I also do not consider this high key as you have a reasonably broad range of tones from pure black to almost white. A high key image should produce a histogram that is shifted greatly to the right. I''m giving you a 5 because I really like the portrait, emotion, and processing. Great job. (my choice would have been: portrait, rule of third (eyes), and soft focus)', '2009-10-30 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706778, 829538, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lovely model. I may be wrong, but the blur appears to have been created, or accentuated, in post, as there appears to be incongruencies of in and out of focus areas. If I''m wrong, strong work with the shallow DOF!</td>', 'Lovely model. I may be wrong, but the blur appears to have been created, or accentuated, in post, as there appears to be incongruencies of in and out of focus areas. If I''m wrong, strong work with the shallow DOF!', '2009-10-30 16:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5706787, 829488, 28427, '<td valign="top">Would have loved seeing a more clear edge separation between the subject and the white background.  Nevertheless this makes a beautiful image.  Hope you have other umbrellas since this one seems to be Total loss.</td>', 'Would have loved seeing a more clear edge separation between the subject and the white background.  Nevertheless this makes a beautiful image.  Hope you have other umbrellas since this one seems to be Total loss.', '2009-10-30 16:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
