(5709971, 829466, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch. Stay away from ISO 1600 on that compact. My Powershot S5 looks even worse at that ISO. For a still life like this, use the lowest ISO your camera has, and whatever aperture gives you the look you want. By using a tripod and self timer to reduce camera shake, you can use as long an exposure as the other settings need.</td>', 'Ouch. Stay away from ISO 1600 on that compact. My Powershot S5 looks even worse at that ISO. For a still life like this, use the lowest ISO your camera has, and whatever aperture gives you the look you want. By using a tripod and self timer to reduce camera shake, you can use as long an exposure as the other settings need.', '2009-11-02 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5709975, 829060, 69008, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a magnificent shot and your new ribbon.  All of the lines in this image as well as the darkness of the mountain in the background work to pull my attention right to the horizon and into the mountains.  The rough rock foreground is beautiful as well.  I like ocean coast scenes, and this is a fine one.</td>', 'Congrats on a magnificent shot and your new ribbon.  All of the lines in this image as well as the darkness of the mountain in the background work to pull my attention right to the horizon and into the mountains.  The rough rock foreground is beautiful as well.  I like ocean coast scenes, and this is a fine one.', '2009-11-02 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
