(5713714, 829559, 38032, '<td valign="top">I cheated.  My wife held the leaf just above the frame.  I focused from there.  I had nice baclight but I did a couple of test shot to get the light I liked.  Thanks for the kind words. =)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by molliefestus:</b></div><hr/><i> I have tried hundreds of times to get a photo similar to this with a leaf frozen in  mid-air.  This is excellent in every way!!  Did you spot meter and/or use selective focus on the leaf? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I cheated.  My wife held the leaf just above the frame.  I focused from there.  I had nice baclight but I did a couple of test shot to get the light I liked.  Thanks for the kind words. =) Originally posted by molliefestus: I have tried hundreds of times to get a photo similar to this with a leaf frozen in  mid-air.  This is excellent in every way!!  Did you spot meter and/or use selective focus on the leaf? ', '2009-11-04 11:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
