(5718699, 829362, 87278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> ok, this is technical...but the little red thingie...bothers me...not totally but it just doesn''t add to the picture...otherwise a great shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t notice the red thingie till u pointed it out!<br/>Yes it does not seem to add anything to the composition but, IMO, it does not distract the viewer either. Of course I am a self confessed poor observer with no eye for detail :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: ok, this is technical...but the little red thingie...bothers me...not totally but it just doesn''t add to the picture...otherwise a great shot   I didn''t notice the red thingie till u pointed it out!Yes it does not seem to add anything to the composition but, IMO, it does not distract the viewer either. Of course I am a self confessed poor observer with no eye for detail :)', '2009-11-08 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 0),
